  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Relaxation and adventure await at Pelican's Nest in The Preserve at Inlet Beach. The home is 1,926 square feet and comfortably sleeps 10 guests in 4 bedrooms (2 master suites) with 3.5 bathrooms. <br><br>This beautiful home is conveniently positioned in The Preserve at Inlet Beach, a quiet community located just north of Highway 98 and behind 30Avenue, a premium shopping center that is home to a host of amazing local restaurants. Hop on a beach cruiser bicycle to get to the beach in style! Come live the 30A life and experience the beach the way it was meant to be!<br><br>The newly constructed 98 Tunnel now makes it safer and easier to reach 30A taking you under the road.<br><br>Newly constructed with a rejuvenating coastal ambiance, this two-story Florida home offers the peace and tranquility of a perfect coastal getaway. Its prime location is just minutes from the sugar-white beaches, as well as plenty of shopping, entertainment, and dining options, all along County Highway 30A! Unique to this community is the access to Lake Powell which is within walking distance from the home. Lake Powell is one of the largest coastal dune lakes in the world!<br><br>Luxury vinyl plank floors, quartz counter-tops, gourmet kitchen, screened-in porch that offers additional dining space, and beachy undertones are just a few of the features that make this multi-level home a worthwhile escape. The open-plan living and dining room offers comfy furnishings and dining for up to 8 guests with additional seating for 4 at the breakfast bar. An outdoor shower is there to rinse all the sand off you after a full day at the beach.<br><br>The first master suite is located on the first floor, sporting a king-sized bed and a private, luxurious bathroom, complete with a double vanity and walk-in shower. The second floor holds three additional bedrooms: a second master suite with a queen-sized bed and a private bathroom with yet another walk-in shower, a further queen bedroom and a bunk room with a twin-over-full bunk bed with a pullout twin trundle. In addition, the second floor loft is set up with a comfortable sitting area and gaming system. The main Living Room sofa is also a queen sized pull out.<br><br>There are 7 TVs in the home - 1 in each bedroom, 1 in the family room, 1 on the lanai and 1 in the loft.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "PELICAN’S NEST - 4 Bedroom Home with Bikes by Rosemary Beach"
        }
      ],
